@startuml
title ASUC-02/03 - Product Analysis and Recommendation
skinparam shadowing false
actor Shopper
boundary "Web UI" as UI
control "REST API" as API
control "Product / Price Query" as Price
control "Discount Analyzer" as Discount
control "Forecast Repository" as Forecast
control "Recommendation Engine" as Rec
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Shopper -> UI : Select product / request recommendation
UI -> API : GET /products/{id}/insights
API -> Price : getProductAndPrices(id)
Price -> DB : query offers and historical prices
DB --> Price : price records + timestamps
Price --> API : product + validated prices
API -> Discount : analyze(prices)
Discount --> API : discount evidence
API -> Forecast : findLatest(id)
Forecast -> DB : query stored forecast
DB --> Forecast : forecast or none
Forecast --> API : forecast + age + status
alt forecast current enough
  API -> Rec : recommend(prices, discount, forecast)
  Rec --> API : buy / wait + reasons
else unavailable or expired
  API -> Rec : recommend(prices, discount, no forecast)
  Rec --> API : rules-only advice or insufficient data
end
API --> UI : JSON insights + timestamps + caveats
UI --> Shopper : Show price history and recommendation
note over API,Forecast
  Interactive API never blocks on a heavy batch forecast.
  Background processing updates saved predictions.
end note
@enduml
